1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
While I was dying in the delivery room, my husband was on a date.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:09,800
He told the nurse, "I only want Irene to bear my children, not a dog like her.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:18,200
I died, but then I woke up. It was the day of our engagement. My ex sneered, "Are you so desperate for me that you’re stalking us?

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,700
You’re pathetic.

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,800
His mistress Irene giggled, "Give up, Serena.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,300
Xavier will only marry me.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,800
You’re just a supporting character in our love story.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,900
They had no idea I remembered everything.

9
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:33,500
The cold hospital, my dead baby, and my parents’ fatal car crash.

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:38,800
I loved him with my whole heart, and he destroyed me.

11
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:44,200
But I also remembered the secret: After I died, Xavier's terrifying uncle Timothy took his own life.

12
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,300
He had thousands of photos of me.

13
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:49,200
He had loved me in silence for years.

14
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,700
When my parents asked who I wanted to marry, I didn't choose the nephew.

15
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:58,400
I looked them in the eye and said: "I want to marry Timothy Sherwood.

16
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:05,900
Xavier used to scream at me for spending a penny. Now, Timothy sent me an unlimited black card. "Spend it all, darling," his message read.

17
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,200
I’m no longer a beggar.

18
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,200
Irene cornered me, screaming that I was stalking "her" man.

19
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,000
I laughed and whispered: "Keep him.

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,299
I’m busy buying a dress to become your future Aunt.
